{"ID":"20251112153756-pqb2i27","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251112153756-pqb2i27","title":"UPL9-11——降低 Shader 填充率压力","type":"doc","updated":"20251112165527"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112153756-uq0e2c9","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251112153756-uq0e2c9","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251112154145-kqnstpl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251112154145-kqnstpl","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"回顾：关于填充率的优化思路"}]},{"ID":"20251112154158-4dgcydk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154158-4dgcydk","updated":"20251112154230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251103113736-y6c1utd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL8——影响 GPU 性能的主要因素"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 填充率部分"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-3pgispv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-3pgispv","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-eubg3uz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-eubg3uz","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-xaev3pl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-xaev3pl","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低要处理的像素（片元）数量"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-j98m450","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-j98m450","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-0vdhxr2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-0vdhxr2","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-h1z2sqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-h1z2sqb","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低分辨率"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-a3twcpp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-a3twcpp","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-z8iwnn3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-z8iwnn3","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-mt3ub2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-mt3ub2f","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态分辨率（Dynamic Resolution Scaling）"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-4h13mdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-4h13mdo","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本原理：\n在 GPU 压力大时，降低渲染分辨率，然后再放大到屏幕分辨率输出\n在 GPU 空闲时，提高渲染分辨率，获得更清晰的画面\n目标是保持 稳定帧率，URP 项目中有动态分辨率功能开关"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-6a95z4t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-6a95z4t","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-ueesxj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-ueesxj0","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注视点渲染（Foveated Rendering）"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-85n02r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-85n02r1","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本原理：\n人眼的视觉分辨率，中央注视点区域最清晰，周边区域分辨率敏感度低\n在中央区域渲染高分辨率，在边缘区域渲染低分辨率，从而减少像素处理量\n一般 VR 项目中会使用\n一般 VR 设备会提供对应功能，通过设备 API 开启"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-u1vnaoq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-u1vnaoq","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-xfgr8cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-xfgr8cn","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低项目分辨率"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-gbeav6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-gbeav6q","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基于目标设备，合理设定项目目标分辨率"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-t96x9qd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-t96x9qd","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-zknht0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-zknht0w","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少或优化屏幕后处理效果的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-kcfgd8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-kcfgd8x","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 1/2 或 1/4 分辨率下渲染，或直接不使用"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-j5f6vyu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-j5f6vyu","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-q9oslq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-q9oslq9","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低抗锯齿采样次数或关闭"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-3o08yrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-3o08yrb","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4×MSAA ——\u003e 2×MSAA 或关闭"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-rx7c9is","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-rx7c9is","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-06ji01p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-06ji01p","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少单个像素（片元）计算量"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-3q37n0t","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-3q37n0t","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-frp4vqw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-frp4vqw","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-jl1xkwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-jl1xkwo","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"控制 Shader Pass 数量"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-h560whb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-h560whb","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能合并的效果放在一个 Pass，避免片元被重复算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-np8dfyp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-np8dfyp","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-5wk9hku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-5wk9hku","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少半透明的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-fh394vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-fh394vw","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少层数，必要时用 透明测试（AlphaTest）\n可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241120123139-t3fekhe","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US3S3L4——透明度测试"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-phntumr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-phntumr","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-i1wzpy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-i1wzpy8","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合理使用光照模式"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-mn7y2r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-mn7y2r3","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少用逐像素实时光照"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-75hxosm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-75hxosm","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-bzik9sb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-bzik9sb","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少纹理采样次数"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-x4ssgcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-x4ssgcp","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并贴图、使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230727203130-4rvs7r1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Mipmap"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-evkuwc4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-evkuwc4","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-l46qevi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-l46qevi","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免无效像素（片元）计算"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-i6kdecf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-i6kdecf","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-e7uu6m2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-e7uu6m2","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-jlkxcix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-jlkxcix","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少 OverDraw"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-npa4z1w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-npa4z1w","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-7u87ymk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-7u87ymk","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优化UI系统"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-4blm6xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-4blm6xo","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少叠层，避免全屏大半透明面板，合并图集减少 DrawCall"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-up9faqe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-up9faqe","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154239-hhxai09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-hhxai09","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剔除不可见对象"}]},{"ID":"20251112154239-sbkrkj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251112154239-sbkrkj0","updated":"20251112154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230709202343-5qy8x8e","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Occlusion Culling"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250918112151-yiebfgs","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"视锥剔除"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154156-f3gb9oo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112154156-f3gb9oo","updated":"20251112154341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁用不需要的特性"}]},{"ID":"20251112154306-voblpvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112154306-voblpvg","updated":"20251112154334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低填充率压力的主要思路就是"}]},{"ID":"20251112154334-n5n8ymk","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112154334-n5n8ymk","updated":"20251112154334"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154334-woj9a1d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112154334-woj9a1d","updated":"20251112154334"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154334-pojxhlt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112154334-pojxhlt","updated":"20251112154334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少被着色的像素数"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154334-alvzmig","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112154334-alvzmig","updated":"20251112154334"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154334-jwl69i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112154334-jwl69i5","updated":"20251112154334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少每个像素的着色成本"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154306-njgfb36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112154306-njgfb36","updated":"20251112154338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而着色器中的透明度、深度写入、透明度测试、透明度混合等特性\n都会增加每个像素的着色成本，会进行更多的计算和逻辑处理\n因此，少一个特性就等于少一段像素级逻辑，可以有效降低片元着色器工作量"}]},{"ID":"20251112154306-zu22o5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112154306-zu22o5v","updated":"20251112154341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如我们可以通过渲染标签、渲染状态禁用一些处理"}]},{"ID":"20251112154341-tsuzsbm","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112154341-tsuzsbm","updated":"20251112154341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154341-0anye84","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112154341-0anye84","updated":"20251112154341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112154341-6c7unmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112154341-6c7unmy","updated":"20251112154341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不投射阴影"}]},{"ID":"20251112154310-pdrpoyp","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112154310-pdrpoyp","updated":"20251112154314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Tags { \"ForceNoShadowCasting\" = \"True\" }\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112165112-lx4hfgg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112165112-lx4hfgg","updated":"20251112165112"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112165112-qwh0dls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112165112-qwh0dls","updated":"20251112165115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关闭深度缓冲"}]},{"ID":"20251112154322-3qm3lv2","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112154322-3qm3lv2","updated":"20251112154327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"ZWrite Off    // 不写入深度缓冲\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112154320-ci5zvs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112154320-ci5zvs5","updated":"20251112154320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251112155535-5v7njql","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112155535-5v7njql","updated":"20251112155825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用基于着色器的 LOD"}]},{"ID":"20251112155543-ev1rpvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155543-ev1rpvf","updated":"20251112155548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以强制 Unity 使用更简单的着色器来渲染远端对象，这是一种节省填充率的有效方法\n特别是将游戏部署到多个平台或者需要支持多种硬件功能时"}]},{"ID":"20251112155543-qpqhik1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155543-qpqhik1","updated":"20251112155543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader LOD 就是给 Shader 提供多档复杂度版本\n引擎根据全局或局部 Shader 的 maximumLOD 参数选择合适的 SubShader\n从而减少片元计算开销，从而降低填充率压力"}]},{"ID":"20251112155553-19j0otn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155553-19j0otn","updated":"20251112155557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20251112155557-v8kzs1f","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112155557-v8kzs1f","updated":"20251112155628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Shader \"Custom/LODExample\"\n{\n    SubShader {\n        LOD 300\n        Pass {\n            // 高级效果（带法线贴图、PBR 等）\n        }\n    }\n    SubShader {\n        LOD 150\n        Pass {\n            // 中级效果（只有 Diffuse + 简单光照）\n        }\n    }\n    SubShader {\n        LOD 50\n        Pass {\n            // 最低级效果（纯颜色/贴图）\n        }\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251112155605-allo2su","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155605-allo2su","updated":"20251112155804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中："}]},{"ID":"20251112155805-k691stg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112155805-k691stg","updated":"20251112155814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"//全局修改：\nShader.globalMaximumLOD = 200;\n//局部修改，只对某个 Shader 生效\nShader s = Shader.Find(\"着色器路径\");\ns.maximumLOD = 150;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251112155825-c54vyvl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112155825-c54vyvl","updated":"20251112165527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用光照剔除"}]},{"ID":"20251112155833-m1egmu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155833-m1egmu7","updated":"20251112155902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照相关的计算是着色器处理中的高开销项，灯光组件上有 Culling Mask (剔除遮罩，内置渲染管线) 或 Rendering Layer Mask (渲染图层蒙版，SRP管线)\n他们的作用都是决定场景中哪些层级的对象会受到该光源影响，我们可以通过该参数让某些层不被对应光源影响\n通过它们来限制光源影响范围，从而减少着色器中光照相关的计算"}]},{"ID":"20251112165340-fu5mlfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112165340-fu5mlfo","updated":"20251112165527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251112165527-9evu2lb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251112155904-85kmftf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112155904-85kmftf","updated":"20251112155935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谨慎使用实时阴影"}]},{"ID":"20251112155914-wmp08r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155914-wmp08r3","updated":"20251112155923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实时阴影的渲染过程消耗是比较大的\n因为在渲染底层，会渲染阴影贴图，片元阶段还会进行阴影贴图采样，进行过滤处理等等\n因此尽量避免使用实时阴影，可以有效减少渲染和采样计算压力。"}]},{"ID":"20251112155926-vwpqqjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155926-vwpqqjc","updated":"20251112155928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以采用以下方式去优化："}]},{"ID":"20251112155923-5sox5ij","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112155923-5sox5ij","updated":"20251112155923"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112155923-5bp94gz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112155923-5bp94gz","updated":"20251112155923"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112155923-t3e5y0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155923-t3e5y0h","updated":"20251112155923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烘焙光照阴影"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112155923-6oqo3w1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112155923-6oqo3w1","updated":"20251112155923"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112155923-129hcap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112155923-129hcap","updated":"20251112155923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低阴影质量的方式"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112155935-gnremkr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112155935-gnremkr","updated":"20251112160025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用烘焙的光照纹理"}]},{"ID":"20251112160004-n1pwjfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160004-n1pwjfj","updated":"20251112160006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实时光源计算会对渲染造成很大的压力，每个像素的计算量会很大\n因此，通过使用烘焙光照纹理的方式，可以大幅减少每像素的实时光照计算与采样"}]},{"ID":"20251112160017-mwex1b4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160017-mwex1b4","updated":"20251112160017"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160017-zy54rtz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160017-zy54rtz","updated":"20251112160017"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160017-mgyza0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160017-mgyza0k","updated":"20251112160017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态物体我们可以使用 光照烘焙贴图"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112160018-arlzohz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160018-arlzohz","updated":"20251112160018"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160018-x81hy23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160018-x81hy23","updated":"20251112160018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态物体我们可以使用 Light Probe（光照探针）、Reflection Probe（反射探针）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112160016-8lrdjt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160016-8lrdjt0","updated":"20251112160016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251112160012-sdxynkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160012-sdxynkr","updated":"20251112160012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过这些方式我们可以有效减少光照处理带来的压力"}]},{"ID":"20251112160004-ado2vxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160004-ado2vxj","updated":"20251112160014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路就是把实时的计算改为提前算好，从纹理中取出算好的颜色进行渲染"}]},{"ID":"20251112160025-0wz971a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251112160025-0wz971a","updated":"20251112160227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少多重渲染目标 (MRT)"}]},{"ID":"20251112160034-2i9f7j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160034-2i9f7j7","updated":"20251112160107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多重渲染目标 (MRT, Multiple Render Targets)，表示 一次绘制调用中，同时输出到多张 Render Target (RT)\n比如："}]},{"ID":"20251112160040-iuwpbm0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251112160040-iuwpbm0","updated":"20251112160100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"struct FragOut\n{\n    float4 color0 : SV_Target0;\n    float4 color1 : SV_Target1;\n    float4 color2 : SV_Target2;\n};\n\nFragOut frag()\n{\n    FragOut o;\n    o.color0 = ...; // G-Buffer Albedo\n    o.color1 = ...; // G-Buffer Normal\n    o.color2 = ...; // G-Buffer Specular\n    return o;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251112160039-w7k89af","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160039-w7k89af","updated":"20251112160039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样 GPU 一次片元着色，就能把结果写入多张纹理"}]},{"ID":"20251112160034-6hif9wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160034-6hif9wa","updated":"20251112160210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MRT 一般用在"}]},{"ID":"20251112160113-28a20gw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160113-28a20gw","updated":"20251112160148"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160113-lbpw8ct","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160113-lbpw8ct","updated":"20251112160148"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160113-6l3us8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160113-6l3us8g","updated":"20251112160113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"延迟渲染中使用"}]},{"ID":"20251112160113-piocdyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160113-piocdyv","updated":"20251112160148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"G-Buffer 通常需要 3–5 张纹理存储不同的材质信息\n一次几何 Pass 写多个 RT，下一步光照 Pass 再利用这些数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112160113-d1p7u1b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160113-d1p7u1b","updated":"20251112160113"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160113-xnfsf03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160113-xnfsf03","updated":"20251112160113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自定义特效"}]},{"ID":"20251112160120-g37v3tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160120-g37v3tg","updated":"20251112160120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需要同时输出颜色和 ID 贴图、或者存储额外的 Mask 数据"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112160034-2vulv7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160034-2vulv7n","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MRT 带来的开销："}]},{"ID":"20251112160216-i4lbeok","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160216-i4lbeok","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160216-ly1d4eq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160216-ly1d4eq","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160216-rcwh185","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160216-rcwh185","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"填充率压力更大"}]},{"ID":"20251112160217-iehqs04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160217-iehqs04","updated":"20251112160217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本来只写一个 RT（一次片元输出），现在要写 3–4 个 RT → 每个像素的写入次数成倍增加"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112160216-85345lh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160216-85345lh","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160216-s8lh8mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160216-s8lh8mr","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显存占用更大"}]},{"ID":"20251112160219-wl3am5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160219-wl3am5d","updated":"20251112160219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个 RT 都是一张纹理（可能是全屏大小），分辨率越高，显存压力越大"}]}]},{"ID":"20251112160216-18yzbps","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251112160216-18yzbps","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251112160216-w1ssps0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160216-w1ssps0","updated":"20251112160216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"带宽受限时特别明显"}]},{"ID":"20251112160220-quwiqty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160220-quwiqty","updated":"20251112160220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尤其在移动平台，GPU 的 ROP（光栅输出单元）数量有限，同时写多个 RT 可能导致瓶颈"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251112160034-avkm72r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251112160034-avkm72r","updated":"20251112160227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此我们应该 能不用 MRT 就不用\n如果一定要使用，也应该通过纹理合并、纹理压缩、降低精度、避免无效输出 方式去进行优化\n在移动平台上对 MRT 的支持有限，建议谨慎使用"}]}]}